<title>USA: Helix Technology to rescind share buyback.</title>
<headline>Helix Technology to rescind share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Mass. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helix Technology Corp said on Friday its board of directors voted to rescind the company's previously announced 500,000 share repurchase plan due to uncertainty over U.S. Securities and Exchange rules.</p>
<p>The company said there were questions about SEC interpretation of a Staff Accounting bulletin related to pooling of interest accounting in certain types of acquistions.</p>
<p>Helix Technology develops and applies cryogenic and vacuum technology.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
